  "description": "Repo-aware CRUD slice generator for the Dabbler platform Access-migration pipeline. Run `dabbler-crud-slice` to scaffold a convention-correct CRUD slice (service + page + controller + registration helpers) from a reviewed .dabbler-entity.json. Bundles the Dabbler.SchemaApplicator transformer in-process and shells out to the Dabbler.Templates `dotnet new` templates, which must be installed at the same version (`dotnet new install Dabbler.Templates::<version>`).",
